  "content": "\n\n<p>\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/refs/heads/dev/images/logo.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fflightassistant\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 获取\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fflightassistant%252fversions%253fl%253dforge%2526l%253dneoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持 Forge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5kcBCvnbTp\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 Discord 上与社区交流\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>FlightAssistant</strong> 是一款功能强大的客户端模组，为《我的世界》的鞘翅添加了完全可配置的完整航电系统、态势感知工具以及高级自动化功能，同时依然对休闲玩家友好。 </p>\n<h2>主要功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>完全可自定义的飞行 HUD (<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/HUD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>)<ul>\n<li>实时显示详细飞行数据的信息面板\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/full_screenshot_alt.png\"></li></ul></li>\n<li>智能飞行安全警报 (<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Alerts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>)<ul>\n<li>在情况恶化前及时察觉不安全飞行条件\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/alert_display_alt.png\"></li></ul></li>\n<li>无感自动飞行保护 (<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Flight-protections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>)<ul>\n<li>当你分心时，FlightAssistant 会自动为你提供保护</li>\n<li>示例：避免落地碰撞伤害、避免虚空伤害、自动展开鞘翅</li></ul></li>\n<li>具备航线规划能力的高级自动驾驶仪：完全解放双手，安全飞行 (<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Autopilot:-overview-and-basics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>)<ul>\n<li>飞行计划可保存至磁盘，供日后加载</li>\n<li>借助飞行计划，可实现从起飞到降落的完全自动化飞行\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/full_screenshot.png\"></li></ul></li>\n</ul>",
